# Flow Git and Secret Safety

## Never stage

```text
.env*
apps/web/scripts/debug-*.mjs
supabase/config.toml
playwright/.auth/*
test-results/*
playwright-report/*
.next/*
dist/*
```

## Never run without explicit user approval

```text
git add .
git add -A
git reset --hard
git clean
git stash pop|apply|drop|clear
```

## Never do automatically

- Apply or delete existing stashes
- Merge feature branches into `main`
- Force push to `main`

## Staging discipline

Stage explicit paths only. Before commit, scan for:

- `sb_secret_`, service-role keys, JWTs, passwords, database URLs, private keys, API keys

## Secret scan

```bash
node .cursor/hooks/secret-scan.mjs
```
